      "id": 1350173,
      "name": "[Banyue] Scorching Karma",
      "desc": "For each 1 Energy or Adrenaline other squad members consume, if Banyue is not in <color=#FFFFFF>Visage of Wrath</color> state, he will recover 0.3 <color=#FFFFFF>Wrathful Fires</color>. With at least 120 <color=#FFFFFF>Wrathful Fires</color>, Banyue's next switch-in will directly trigger <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Assist</color>. When coming on-field through this method with at least 120 <color=#FFFFFF>Wrathful Fires</color>, Banyue immediately enters <color=#FFFFFF>Visage of Wrath</color> state and increases his <color=#FF5521>Fire DMG</color> by <color=#2BAD00>60%</color> for 20s.",
